  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電磁學(一)",
    "sub_ename": "ELECTROMAGNETICS(1)",
    "describe_ch": "隨著無線通信及高速數位電路技術與應用的發展，舉凡電路、天線、以及信號傳輸等都必須仰賴電磁原理，學生應對相關領域的技術能力與要求具有基本的了解能力，本課程將從介紹電磁學在無線通信系統各方面所扮演的角色開始，而有別於一般傳統從靜場理論逐次展開的學方式，我們將從學生比較容易理解吸收的傳輸線現象與理論開始，因此學生只需要基本的電路學基礎便可逐步推展到電磁波的傳播應用。",
    "describe_eh": "Since technologies and applications of wireless communications and high-speed digital circuit are booming, the circuits, antennas and signal transmissions all depend on electromagnetic principles. The students should respond to the demand with technical capability from the field. This course begins with an introduction describing the role that electromagnetics has in various aspects of wireless communications system. Compared to the classical approach starting with static fields, we begin with transmission line to provide a smooth transition from circuit theory to propagation concept of electromagnetic waves.",
    "pre_subname": "COME2002電子學(一)、COME2008電路學(一)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "COME2002",
    "pre_sub_ename": "COME2002 ELECTRONICS(1)、COME2008 CIRCUIT THEORY(1)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能用自己的詞彙定義何謂傳輸線：能夠描述重要的傳輸線種類及其特性；能夠描述影響傳輸線的重要影響因素，能瞭解並說明電磁學在目前的社會生活及經濟層面的重要性及影響",
      "describe_en": "Define transmission line with their own words: Be able to describe transmission line and their characteristics; be able to describe important factors impacting transmission line. Distinguish and make clear statement where electromagnetics techniques and p"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能辨識出可應用電磁學的場合，並能清楚表達，能使用相關原理，可評估電磁學應用及其限制的相關分析，並由分析中歸納出適當結論",
      "describe_en": "Be able to use related principles to plan an evaluation about measuring electromagnetics' capability and limitation, and draw appropriate conclusions from analysis."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "知道於何處可找到電磁學的相關資訊、研究結果及標準，並可評估所獲資訊的適用性，能利用電磁學的原理，評估一產品或系統，並提出可行驗證方法",
      "describe_en": "Know where to locate and access related electromagnetics information, research, as well as standards, and be able to evaluate the appropriateness of the obtained information."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "能針對一特定有關電磁學的議題或情境，設計一合理模擬，加以驗證，並適切歸納出結論，能以書面或口頭方式將所獲結果與同儕、助教及教師溝通",
      "describe_en": " Design a reasonable simulation for a specific electromagnetics issue or scenario, conduct the simulation, and draw appropriate conclusions. Communicate results in written or oral form to classmates, teaching assistants, and the instructor."
    }
  ],
